   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Solve the system by a method of your choice:\n<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{rcl}{y}&amp;{ = }&amp;{3x - 5} \\\\{ - 18x + 6y}&amp;{ = }&amp;{ - 30} \\\\ \\end{array}  \\right.\">\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{rcl}{y}&amp;{ = }&amp;{3x - 5} \\\\{ - 18x + 6y}&amp;{ = }&amp;{ - 30} \\\\ \\end{array}  \\right.</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\left\\{ {\\begin{array}{*{20}{c}}\n{y = 3x - 5}\\\\\n{ - 18x + 6y =  - 30}\n\\end{array}} \\right.\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 1: Solve one of the equations for either variable.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"y = 3x - 5\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 2: Substitute the expression from Step 1 into the other equation.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\" - 18x + 6y =  - 30\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\" - 18x + 6\\left( {3x - 5} \\right) =  - 30\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 3: Solve the resulting equation.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\" - 18x + 6\\left( {3x - 5} \\right) =  - 30\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\" - 18x + 18x - 30 =  - 30\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\" - 30 =  - 30\"></span></p>\n<p>This is always true. This system has infinitely many solutions.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "There are infinitely many solutions to this system."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
